  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Feng Jiu Ge’s Central Continent group cuts through saint regional wall, she sighs that many days of searching finally found a usable weak spot. With Fairy Ao Xue she activates the killer move whose core is rank seven crescent moon Immortal Gu with two rank six Immortal Gu as support; one Gu Immortal alone cannot display its might. The blue crescent moon cuts about seventy-six steps into the wall. Deeper in, pressure stops them from using that move again, and a thousand steps later the two walk supporting each other.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_fairy_ao_xue",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a peerless beauty with grand elegance.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Fairy Ao Xue stare with their beautiful eyes wide open.",
      "chapters": [
        924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Fairy Ao Xue are among those quite heavily injured around Qin Bai Sheng after that fight.",
      "chapters": [
        765
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-search-party",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While they hide and watch, she argues they might as well go to Jade Pool blessed land after so many days with no target, then falls silent when Old Man Tian Long treats that as an insult to Black Heaven Temple’s defending day and night.",
      "chapters": [
        811
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-search-party",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land",
        "char_old_man_tian_long",
        "loc_black_heaven_temple"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Luo Po Valley she and Fairy Ao Xue cannot match He Lang Zi and Hui Feng Zi’s counterattack and can only retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-search-party",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She comes from Heaven’s Envy Manor. She and Fairy Ao Xue control rank seven crescent moon Gu and can unleash peerless crescent moon slash together, a signature famous killer move of Heaven’s Envy Manor. They are hardly ever separated, but at Luo Po Valley limited numbers force them to split while encircling a huge area. When Shadow Sect bursts out she is caught alone, destroys an Immortal Gu to stall three breaths, and escapes through a Gu formation Hong Chi Ming set, pale and grateful for that formation. During the hundred days battle their combined peerless crescent moon slash injured almost all Shadow Sect Gu Immortals to varying degrees. Mystical light from the valley hits both fairies. Feng Jiu Ge shouts that the light is harmless, then stops resisting and is dragged deeper into Luo Po Valley; they decide to believe him, stop resisting, and enter as well, reaching a hidden Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavens_envy_sect",
        "gu_crescent_moon_gu",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_hong_chi_ming",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside that space she asks whether it truly is Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable’s inheritance and what criteria decide the heir. They hold back from attacking when Feng Jiu Ge warns that strikes lengthen the trap, then scream as Qin Bai Sheng’s suicide raises winds of assimilation and activate Gu worms to protect their bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the outer battle, the remaining Central Continent Gu Immortals try to save Feng Jiu Ge, her, and Fairy Ao Xue, confirm the true inheritance, and cannot enter; talk among them notes that if the two fairies die, Heaven’s Envy Manor loses peerless crescent moon slash.",
      "chapters": [
        927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "luo-po-valley-trap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, inside Spirit Affinity House, Li Jun Ying states that Heaven’s Envy Manor has sent news of the deaths of Ao Xue and Ling Mei.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-notice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "char_li_jun_ying"
      ]
    }
  ],
